WEBVTT

00:07:29.704 --> 00:07:32.579
as a way to recognize
that you're a guest on their homeland.

00:07:32.579 --> 00:07:34.663
Way easier than dealing with the IRS.

00:07:35.913 --> 00:07:38.996
Or maybe you do own land,
but you need to live there for now.

00:07:39.454 --> 00:07:41.496
You can set up a bequest in your will

00:07:41.496 --> 00:07:43.538
so that your estate
goes back to the tribe.

00:07:44.579 --> 00:07:46.913
I'm not saying that any of this is easy.

00:07:47.329 --> 00:07:49.788
Unsettling is hard work,

00:07:49.788 --> 00:07:54.329
especially in places where Indigenous
people were removed or erased.

00:07:55.579 --> 00:08:00.371
That absence tends to be papered over
with the myth that colonialism worked.